cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Richieste: requests for chemical, mechanical and barrier tests to a materials laboratory (db, 1998–2000)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Richieste manages the requests addressed to the materials laboratory of a plastic-film manufacturer. Each request records requester, producer, product, customer, description and reason, with the requested, planned and actual dates and the delay; the results are entered in three sheets: chemical and barrier properties (nature, fillers, residual VCM, stabilisation, colour difference, gas permeability), mechanical properties (specific weight, Vicat, impact strength, tensile properties at yield and break, elastic modulus, roughness, reflectance, wettability, shrinkage, tear, hardness, adhesion) and other tests."
authors:
